WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:03.436
- NOW FIRST,
LET ME JUST SAY

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:06.539
THAT I'M ENCOURAGED THAT SO MANY
OF YOU FROM THE REPUBLICAN PARTY

00:00:06.706 --> 00:00:09.943
HAVE AGREED
TO MEET ME IN THIS WAY.

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:12.178
NOW, AS YOU KNOW,
I'VE TRIED VERY HARD

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:14.280
TO REACH ACROSS THE AISLE

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:16.282
AND GOVERN THIS COUNTRY
FROM THE MIDDLE.

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:17.650
- WELL...

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:20.987
ALL DUE RESPECT,
MR. PRESIDENT,

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:23.423
WE DISAGREE WITH YOU.

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:26.292
- WE THINK YOU SHOULD
RUN THE COUNTRY FROM...

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:28.194
NOT THE MIDDLE.

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:30.797
- WELL,
THAT'S WHY WE'RE HERE.

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:33.099
IF YOU WOULD, I'D JUST
APPRECIATE SOME FEEDBACK

00:00:33.266 --> 00:00:35.802
ON SOME NEW IDEAS
AND DIRECTIONS FOR THIS COUNTRY.

00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:39.039
FEEL FREE TO AGREE
OR DISAGREE.

00:00:39.205 --> 00:00:41.007
WHATEVER YOU WANT.

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:42.776
- WE'RE GONNA DISAGREE.

00:00:42.942 --> 00:00:44.177
[chuckling and murmuring]

00:00:44.344 --> 00:00:46.413
- YEAH, DISAGREE.
- DISAGREE.

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:48.181
- [whispering]
DISAGREE.

00:00:48.348 --> 00:00:52.419
- FIRST, I THINK
THE GOVERNMENT IS TOO BIG.

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:54.120
I THINK WE NEED
TO SHRINK THE SIZE

00:00:54.287 --> 00:00:56.823
OF THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT
SO THAT ALL DECISIONS

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:58.758
CAN BE MADE
AT THE STATE LEVEL.

00:00:58.925 --> 00:01:00.760
- WE DISAGREE, MR. PRESIDENT.

00:01:00.927 --> 00:01:03.096
- MM-HMM.

00:01:03.263 --> 00:01:05.465
- YOU DRIVE
A HARD BARGAIN, YOU WIN.

00:01:05.632 --> 00:01:08.068
[chuckling]

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:10.837
- THERE WE GO.

00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:13.740
- BIG GOVERNMENT IT IS.

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:15.542
[classical music]

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:17.343
- ALL RIGHT, NEXT UP, THIS
HAS BEEN A HOT BUTTON ISSUE,

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:20.113
BUT I THINK WE CAN
SETTLE IT RIGHT HERE.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:22.849
NO TAXES FOR RICH PEOPLE.

00:01:23.016 --> 00:01:24.250
- WE COMPLETELY DISAGREE!

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:26.052
- ROUND TWO
GOES TO YOU GUYS.

00:01:26.219 --> 00:01:27.954
[uncomfortable chuckling]

00:01:28.121 --> 00:01:29.289
- OKAY.
- UH-HUH.

00:01:29.456 --> 00:01:31.091
- MORE TAXES
FOR THE RICH.

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:32.492
- AHEM!
- WHAT THE [bleep]!

00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:35.428
- WHAT IS HAPPENING TO US?

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:37.797
- MAN, I AM TAKING
A BEATING HERE, GUYS.

00:01:37.964 --> 00:01:39.299
ALL RIGHT, LAST ISSUE.

00:01:39.466 --> 00:01:40.733
IMMIGRATION.

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:43.403
NOW WE NEED
TO SECURE OUR BORDERS.

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:46.072
AND ANYBODY
WHO'S HERE ILLEGALLY

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:49.209
SHOULD BE HUNTED DOWN
AND DEPORTED.

00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:51.778
- GSSK!

00:01:51.945 --> 00:01:53.246
GAAK!

00:01:53.413 --> 00:01:54.814
NNG!
WE DISAGREE!

00:01:54.981 --> 00:01:56.082
AAH!
- DAMN!

00:01:56.249 --> 00:01:57.417
NNGH!

00:01:57.584 --> 00:02:00.987
[crying]

00:02:01.154 --> 00:02:03.556
- WE ARE COUNTRY OF IMMIGRANTS!
NOOOOOO!

00:02:03.723 --> 00:02:06.559
- WE NEED A CLEAR PATH
TO CITIZENSHIP

00:02:06.726 --> 00:02:08.928
FOR ALL OF THOSE
WHO ARE ALREADY HERE!

00:02:09.095 --> 00:02:11.764
AAH!
HELP ME!

00:02:11.931 --> 00:02:13.266
[crying, screaming]

00:02:13.433 --> 00:02:15.735
MMM! MMM!

00:02:15.902 --> 00:02:19.239
[crying, screaming]

00:02:19.405 --> 00:02:21.374
- GREAT,
I LOVE YOUR IDEAS.

00:02:21.541 --> 00:02:24.144
LASTLY, WE CANNOT
REGULATE FIREARMS.

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:25.979
- [muffled]
YES, WE CAN!

00:02:26.146 --> 00:02:29.215
all: [chanting]
YES, WE CAN! YES, WE CAN!

00:02:29.382 --> 00:02:31.351
YES, WE CAN!
YES, WE CAN!

00:02:31.518 --> 00:02:33.853
[crying]

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:36.856
- ALL RIGHT, ALL RIGHT.
IF YOU GUYS SAY SO.

00:02:37.023 --> 00:02:39.692
AND NOBODY BETTER
THROW ME A CIGARETTE.

00:02:43.296 --> 00:02:46.032
AIN'T I A STINKER?

